note gpu-dump.om: emit the gk and gr kernels for the small parity shape and write the whole 64-slot
note code image gkcode (16 KiB per slot, 1 MiB) to stdout. No GPU is touched. tests/omegallm/gpu-disasm.sh
note appends this unit to the gb10 sources without gg.om and feeds the slots to nvdisasm.
fn main to int
grset 256 32 64 2 128 2
if not grall
exit 3
end
if not gkall
exit 2
end
w = write 1 gkcode 0 1048576
exit 0
end
